    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Un viaggio che parte dall\u2019America fino ai vicoli di Napoli attraverso l\u2019opera di Elena Ferrante, i luoghi dei suoi romanzi e lo sguardo di grandi personaggi e testimoni d\u2019eccezione.",
        "english": "The film uses re-enactments of scenes from Ferrante\u2019s novels in the real locations where they are set, archival materials and photographs, and animation inserts to reconstruct Ferrante\u2019s narrative universe, according to the production notes. What \u201cFerrante Fever\u201d will not be is an investigation into the real identity of Elena Ferrante, a subject which made headlines recently. The documentary will, however, look into Ferrante\u2019s choice to remain anonymous."
